{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
He wipes the tears from every eye
[Bb]And death shall be no [Cm7]more
No [Eb]grief, no pain, no mourning cry
Up[Abmaj7]on that shining [Eb]shore
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
The former things have [Abmaj7]passed a[Eb]way
The [Abmaj7]one up[Eb]on the [Bb]throne
Says, [Cm]I make all things [Abmaj7]new to[Eb]day
And [Abmaj7]claims us [Bb]as his [Eb]own
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
So write it down, these words are true
[Bb]And trustworthy and [Cm7]sure
Lord, [Eb]make my weary spirit new
[Abmaj7]Till I am home se[Eb]cure
